errnoprobe: the program's own line
@etude 1 begin guest.default.errnoprobe
@etude 1 assert enosys-unimplemented pass
@etude 1 assert enosys-out-of-range pass
@etude 1 notrun enoent-open /no_such_file_errnoprobe exists
@etude 1 assert ebadf-close pass
@etude 1 assert ebadf-read pass
@etude 1 assert efault-writev pass
@etude 1 end 6
